course: dictionary
lesson: 14245
title: Negation: saying no
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Negation means turning a sentence into its opposite, usually by saying «no» or «not». «The cat is on the mat.» becomes «The cat is not on the mat.» The second sentence says the opposite of the first.
explain: Negation words include not, never, no, nobody and nothing. «Nobody came to the party.» means that no one came. Don't is negation too, because it is short for do not: «I don't like cold porridge.»
explain: In maths and logic, a negation is the opposite of a statement. The negation of «it is raining» is «it is not raining». If the first statement is false, its negation is true.
explain: In formal writing, negation can mean cancelling something out. «Cheating is the negation of fair play» means cheating is the complete opposite of fair play, so it destroys it.
fact: Negation means saying no or not, or turning a sentence into its opposite.
fact: Negation words include «not», «never», «no», «nobody» and «nothing».
fact: «Don't» is a negation because it is short for «do not».
fact: In logic, the negation of «it is raining» is «it is not raining».
fact: «Negation» can also mean the complete opposite or cancelling out of something.
exercise: Which sentence is the negation of «She likes music.»? | «Music likes her.» | «She is music.» | «She likes music too.» | *«She does not like music.»
exercise: «Nobody came to the party.» Which word makes this sentence a negation? | the | came | *Nobody | party
exercise: What is the negation of «it is raining»? | «It is raining hard.» | «Rain is wet.» | *«It is not raining.»
test: Which word does NOT make a sentence negative? | *always | not | no | never
test: In logic, when is the negation of a statement true? | Always | Never | *When the statement is false | When the statement is true
exam: What does «cheating is the negation of fair play» mean? | Cheating is the same as fair play. | Cheating is a type of fair play. | *Cheating is the complete opposite of fair play, cancelling it out. | Cheating is a sport played outdoors.
